'''Aspect of Lunaris''' is a Pantheon [[aspect]] skill that grants a [[buff]] which grants Lunar Protection or Lunar Resistance stacks on taking physical or elemental damage respectively, stackable buffs which lessen physical or elemental damage. Only one aspect skill can be active at a time.

==Mechanics==
Lunar Protection causes you to take 2% less physical damage per stack; Lunar Resistance causes you to take 2% less elemental damage per stack. These two buffs are independent. These buffs can each stack up to 8 times, up to 16% less physical and elemental damage taken respectively. Gaining a stack will refresh its duration.

Self-damage (e.g. {{il|Boneshatter}}, {{il|Enmity's Embrace}}) can proc these stacks consistently without requiring an enemy to hit you.

As Aspect of Lunaris is not a skill gem, it cannot be supported by {{il|Enlighten Support}}.

==Acquisition==
Aspect of Lunaris is obtained exclusively by using {{il|Brinehook's Ducat}} during [[Allflame crafting]].

